{
  "id": "251",
  "title": "The Necklace",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-03-11",
  "synopsis": "Little Wang wants to make amends with his wife by getting her a necklace.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/359/5020b8c885e883effbdd6ab3561a8b6a484592eb.mp3?1488828587",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "项链\n\n小王和他老婆吵架了。事后他很后悔，觉得不应该和老婆吵架，应该让着她。于是，他决定送给老婆一条项链，让她开心，可是他不知道应该买多长的。\n晚上，他趁老婆熟睡的时候，偷偷拿绳子在她脖子上量。谁知，他老婆突然醒了……",
    "traditional": "項鏈\n\n小王和他老婆吵架了。事後他很後悔，覺得不應該和老婆吵架，應該讓著她。於是，他決定送給老婆一條項鏈，讓她開心，可是他不知道應該買多長的。\n晚上，他趁老婆熟睡的時候，偷偷拿繩子在她脖子上量。誰知，他老婆突然醒了……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Necklace"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小王和他老婆吵架了。",
      "traditional": "小王和他老婆吵架了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng hé tā lǎo po chǎo jià le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "事后他很后悔，觉得不应该和老婆吵架，应该让着她。",
      "traditional": "事後他很後悔，覺得不應該和老婆吵架，應該讓著她。",
      "pinyin": "shì hòu tā hěn hòu huǐ jué de bù yīng gāi hé lǎo po chǎo jià yīng gāi ràng zhe tā",
      "english": "Little Wang had a fight with his wife."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "于是，他决定送给老婆一条项链，让她开心，",
      "traditional": "於是，他決定送給老婆一條項鏈，讓她開心，",
      "pinyin": "yú shì tā jué dìng sòng gěi lǎo po yì tiáo xiàng liàn ràng tā kāi xīn",
      "english": "Afterwards he regretted it, and thought that he shouldn’t argue with his wife, but should give in to her."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "可是他不知道应该买多长的。",
      "traditional": "可是他不知道應該買多長的。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì tā bù zhī dào yīng gāi mǎi duō cháng de",
      "english": "Because of this, he decided to give his wife a necklace to make her happy."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But he didn't know what length he should get."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "晚上，他趁老婆熟睡的时候，",
      "traditional": "晚上，他趁老婆熟睡的時候，",
      "pinyin": "wǎn shang tā chèn lǎo po shú shuì de shí hou",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "偷偷拿绳子在她脖子上量。",
      "traditional": "偷偷拿繩子在她脖子上量。",
      "pinyin": "tōu tōu ná shéng zi zài tā bó zi shang liáng",
      "english": "In the evening, he seized the opportunity when his wife was sound asleep, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "谁知，他老婆突然醒了……",
      "traditional": "誰知，他老婆突然醒了……",
      "pinyin": "shéi zhī tā lǎo po tū rán xǐng le",
      "english": ".. to stealthily use a rope to measure her neck."
    }
  ],
